  "2948": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "Mějme bázi $B=((2,1,0,1)^T,(1,0,1,2)^T)$\nObrazy vektorů $\\vec v_1 = (4,1,2,5)^T,\\vec v_2=(2,2,-2,-2)$ si vyjádříme v bázi B   \n$\\begin{pmatrix}\n2&1&|&4&2\\\\\n1&0&|&1&2\\\\\n0&1&|&2&-2\\\\\n1&2&|&5&-2\n\\end{pmatrix}\\sim\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&|&1&2\\\\\n0&1&|&2&-2\\\\\n0&0&|&0&0\\\\\n0&0&|&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n$    \n$[v_1]_B=(1,2)^T$, $[v_2]_B=(2,-2)^T$   \nMatice operátoru $f$ z $B$ do $B$:   \n$[f]_B^B = \\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\2&-2\\end{pmatrix}$   \n\nCharakteristický polynom této matice je    \n$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\lambda&2\\\\2&-2-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix} = \\lambda^2+\\lambda-2-4 = \\lambda^2+\\lambda-6=(\\lambda+3)(\\lambda-2)$   \nPodprostory vlastních vektorů jsou:   \n$\\ker([f]_B^B+3id_2)$: $\\begin{pmatrix}4&2&|&0\\\\2&1&|&0\\end{pmatrix}$   \n$\\ker([f]_B^B+3id_2)= Span\\{[(1,-2)^T]_B\\}$   \n   \n$\\ker([f]_B^B-2id_2)$: $\\begin{pmatrix}-1&2&|&0\\\\2&-4&|&0\\end{pmatrix}$      \n$\\ker([f]_B^B-2id_2)= Span\\{[(2,1)^T]_B\\}$     \n   \n$[(1,-2)^T]_B = (2-2, 1-0, 0-2, 1-4)^T=(0,1,-2,-3)^T$   \n$[(2,1)^T]_B = (4+1,2+0, 0+1, 2+2)^T=(5,2,1,4)^T$   \n   \nMějme tedy bázi $C = ((0,1,-2,-3)^T,(5,2,1,4)^T)$   \nMatice operátoru $f$ z $C$ do $C$ je:\n$[f]_C^C=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&0\\\\0&2\\end{pmatrix}$   \nTakže $([f]_C^C)^n=\\begin{pmatrix}(-3)^n&0\\\\0&2^n\\end{pmatrix}$   \n   \n$(5,1,3,7)^T = [(-1,1)^T]_C$   \n$f^n((5,1,3,7)^T) = [id]_K^C([f]_C^C)^n)([(-1,1)^T]_C =\\begin{pmatrix}0&5\\\\1&2\\\\-2&1\\\\-3&4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}(-3)^n&0\\\\0&2^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \n\\begin{pmatrix}5*2^n\\\\-(-3)^n+2*2^n\\\\2(-3)^n+2^n\\\\3(-3)^n+4*2^n\\end{pmatrix}$"
      }
    ]
  },
