  "3036": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "Označme $\\mathbf{u}=(2,1,0,1)^T$ a $\\mathbf{v}=(1,0,1,2)^T$. Uvažujme bázu $B=(\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v})$ priestoru $V=\\text{Span}\\{\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v}\\}$. Zadanie nám hovorí $f(\\mathbf{u})=\\mathbf{u}+2\\mathbf{v}$ a $f(\\mathbf{v})=2\\mathbf{u}-2\\mathbf{v}$. Chceme zistiť koľko je $f^n(\\mathbf{u}+3\\mathbf{v})$.\n\nMáme $[f(\\mathbf{u})]_B=(1,2)^T$ a $[f(\\mathbf{v})]_B=(2,-2)^T$. Preto $[f]^B_B=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & -2\n\\end{pmatrix}=:A$. Spočítajme vlastné čísla matice $A$, $\\det(A-xI_2)=(1-x)(-2-x)-4=(x + 3) (x - 2)$. Vlastné čísla tak sú $-3$ a $2$, a príslušné vlastné vektory sú napríklad postupne $(-1,2)^T$ a $(2,1)^T$. Označme $C=((-1,2)^T,(2,1)^T)$ bázu priestoru $\\mathbb{R}^2$. Potom platí, že\n$$ A = [\\text{id}]^C_{K_2} \\begin{pmatrix}\n-3 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2\n\\end{pmatrix}   [\\text{id}]^{K_2}_C,   $$\nteda\n$$ A= \\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-3 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}.  $$\nPo výpočte inverzu dostávame $[\\text{id}]^{K_2}_C=\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}$, a teda \n$$ A^n = \\frac{1}{5}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-3 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2\n\\end{pmatrix}^n\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{5}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n(-3)^n & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2^n\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix} ,   $$\na teda\n$$[f^n(\\mathbf{u}+3\\mathbf{v})]_B= [f^n]_B^B [\\mathbf{u}+3\\mathbf{v}]_B = A^n \\begin{pmatrix}\n1 \\\\\n3  \n\\end{pmatrix} = $$\n$$ = \\frac{1}{5}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n(-3)^n & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2^n\n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1 & 2 \\\\\n2 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\n1 \\\\\n3  \n\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n-(-3)^n + 2\\cdot 2^n \\\\\n2(-3)^n + 2^n\n\\end{pmatrix}. $$\nPreto\n$$ f^n(\\mathbf{u}+3\\mathbf{v}) = (-(-3)^n + 2\\cdot 2^n)\\begin{pmatrix}\n2 \\\\\n1 \\\\\n0 \\\\\n1  \n\\end{pmatrix} + (2(-3)^n + 2^n)\\begin{pmatrix}\n1 \\\\\n0 \\\\\n1 \\\\\n2  \n\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n5\\cdot 2^n \\\\\n-(-3)^n + 2\\cdot 2^n \\\\\n2(-3)^n + 2^n \\\\\n3(-3)^n + 4\\cdot 2^n  \n\\end{pmatrix}. $$"
      }
    ]
  },
